sion to collect stock remotely.\",\"experienceReview\":\"Assessment can support grounded-understanding only when an actual test confirms qualified new information through information-confirmed: personal amount 0.8, cap 1, duration 8 rounds, refresh repetition with a 12-round cooldown; maintained gain 0.035 and decay 0.0015 under the existing rule. Completed paid peeling can qualify for the existing practice:bark-extraction source through practice-confirmed only at its registered real-output milestones: amount 0.4, cap 0.5, duration 8 rounds, refresh with a 12-round cooldown; maintained gain 0.02 and decay 0.001. These are bounded personal feedback, not rewards for requesting, learning, labels, mastery or every repeated operation. Do not add alias sources. Peeling itself supplies no direct nutrition, healing, thermal comfort or survival benefit.\",\"visualReview\":\"Use the existing declared events bark-assessed, bark-peeling-started, bark-peeling-progress, bark-peeling-completed and bark-peeling-stopped. Bind assessment text to observed eligibility and uncertainty, and progress/replay to paid work, actual remaining work, separated bark or fines and the changed core. Display only outputs actually produced; do not depict trunk stripping, a completed bark unit or a drying tray before those states exist. Information-confirmed and practice-confirmed subscriptions retain their existing qualification checks.\",\"learning\":2}]}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}}

